# chore-chart — one chore per line:  <task> | <when>
#
# No "|" means every day. Comma-separate when a chore lands on more than one
# date. Blank lines and lines starting with "#" are ignored.
#
#   daily            every day
#   sat              weekly on that weekday (mon, tues, weds, ...)
#   1st  /  15th     day of the month
#   apr 5            that date each year (two = twice a year)
#   2026-11-23       a one-off on that date
#   1st every 3 months   day of the month, quarterly

Make bed
Dishes / load dishwasher
Wipe kitchen counters
Quick tidy (10 min)

Take out trash / recycling | mon
Laundry | wed
Vacuum | sat
Mop floors | sat
Dust surfaces | sat
Groceries | sat
Clean bathrooms | sun
Change bed sheets | sun
Clean out fridge | sun

Pay bills | 1st
Wipe baseboards | 15th
Clean windows / mirrors | 1st every 3 months
Deep clean oven & microwave | 1st every 3 months
Wash throw blankets & pillows | 1st every 3 months

Clean gutters | apr 5, oct 5
Flip / rotate mattresses | apr 5, oct 5
Swap closet (winter/summer) | apr 1, nov 1
Flush water heater | mar 15

Replace kitchen faucet cartridge | 2026-11-23
Sew on beanie | 2026-12-05
Return library books | 2026-12-20
